.TH geectl-request-search 1  "geectl-request-search 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-request\-search \- List the submit requests matching the filters: a typed search
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl request search\fR [\fB\-\-request\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-project\fR] [\fB\-\-package\fR] [\fB\-\-source\-project\fR] [\fB\-\-source\-package\fR] [\fB\-\-target\-project\fR] [\fB\-\-target\-package\fR] [\fB\-\-creator\fR] [\fB\-\-who\fR] [\fB\-\-reviewer\fR] [\fB\-\-state\fR] [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-exclude\-target\-project\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-history\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-full\-history\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the submit requests matching the filters: a typed search
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-request\-id\fR \fI<REQUEST_IDS>\fR
Only requests with these ids
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR \fI<PROJECT>\fR
Only requests with an action from or to these projects
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
Only requests with an action from or to these packages
.TP
\fB\-\-source\-project\fR \fI<SOURCE_PROJECT>\fR
Only requests with an action from these source projects
.TP
\fB\-\-source\-package\fR \fI<SOURCE_PACKAGE>\fR
Only requests with an action from these source packages
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-project\fR \fI<TARGET_PROJECT>\fR
Only requests with an action to these target projects
.TP
\fB\-\-target\-package\fR \fI<TARGET_PACKAGE>\fR
Only requests with an action to these target packages
.TP
\fB\-\-creator\fR \fI<CREATOR>\fR
Only requests filed by these users
.TP
\fB\-\-who\fR \fI<WHO>\fR
Only requests involving these users
.TP
\fB\-\-reviewer\fR \fI<REVIEWER>\fR
Only requests with an open review addressed to these users. With no `\-\-state`, only new and review requests are listed
.TP
\fB\-\-state\fR \fI<STATE>\fR
Only requests in these states. When none are given, only new, review and declined requests are listed; `\-\-reviewer` narrows this to new and review
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
new
.IP \(bu 2
review
.IP \(bu 2
accepted
.IP \(bu 2
declined
.IP \(bu 2
revoked
.IP \(bu 2
superseded
.IP \(bu 2
deleted
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<TYPES>\fR
Only requests with an action of these types
.TP
\fB\-\-exclude\-target\-project\fR \fI<EXCLUDE_TARGET_PROJECT>\fR
Exclude requests with an action targeting these projects
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-history\fR
Include the history of each request
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-full\-history\fR
Include the full history of each request
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<SINCE>\fR
Only requests with a history entry at or after this date, or a last update at or after it, as `YYYY\-MM\-DD` or `YYYY\-MM\-DDTHH:MM:SS`
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR
Ask the server for at most this many matches
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
